 "text": "Hey there, how are you? It' a bit like walking around with earmuffs on. The world sounds like background noise, not like a story. If you like listening to podcasts, yes. It's just different. Try listening to an audiobook or some music instead, now and then. A diverse listening life is better than getting stuck on one thing. Then try an interview with two people chatting about a project they' worked on. You' pick up names and details, but it feels like one big conversation. Enjoy the adjust and remember, regular podcasts sound just like regular people speaking. It's the double stuff that feels weird.",
